 %s. This amount will be deducted from your balance.'=>'Anda telah menarik %s. Jumlah ini akan dipotong dari saldo Anda.','You already have pending withdraw request(s). Please submit your request after approval or cancellation of your previous request.'=>'Anda sudah memiliki permintaan penarikan yang tertunda. Harap ajukan permintaan Anda setelah permintaan sebelumnya disetujui atau dibatalkan.','You don\'t have sufficient balance for a withdraw request!'=>'Anda tidak memiliki saldo yang cukup untuk mengajukan permintaan penarikan!','A product with this SKU already exists in another vendor.'=>'Produk dengan SKU ini sudah ada di vendor lain.','A product with this SKU already exists.'=>'Produk dengan SKU ini sudah ada.','No matching product exists to update.'=>'Tidak ada produk yang cocok untuk diperbarui.','Cleared all dummy data successfully.'=>'Berhasil menghapus semua data dummy.','Dokan Contact Vendor'=>'Dokan Hubungi Vendor','These emails are sent to a vendor who is contacted by customer via contact form widget '=>'Email ini dikirim ke vendor yang dihubungi oleh pelanggan melalui widget formulir kontak','[{customer_name}] sent you a message from your store at - {site_name}'=>'[{customer_name}] mengirimi Anda pesan dari toko Anda di - {site_name}','{customer_name} - Sent a message from {site_name}'=>'{customer_name} - Mengirim pesan dari {site_name}','Enable/Disable'=>'Aktifkan/Nonaktifkan','Enable this email notification'=>'Aktifkan pemberitahuan email ini','Subject'=>'Subjek','Available placeholders: %s'=>'Placeholder yang tersedia: %s','Email heading'=>'Judul email','Email type'=>'Tipe email','Choose which format of email to send.'=>'Pilih format email yang akan dikirim.','"%1$s" sent you a message from your "%2$s" store'=>'"%1$s" mengirimi Anda pesan dari toko "%2$s" Anda','[%1$s] Refund Request %2$s'=>'[%1$s] Permintaan Pengembalian Dana %2$s','[%s] New Refund Request'=>'[%s] Permintaan Pengembalian Dana Baru','[%s] New Withdraw Request'=>'[%s] Permintaan Penarikan Baru','[%s] Your Withdraw Request has been approved'=>'[%s] Permintaan Penarikan Anda telah disetujui','[%s] Your Withdraw Request has been cancelled'=>'[%s] Permintaan Penarikan Anda telah dibatalkan','[%s] New Vendor Registered'=>'[%s] Vendor Baru Terdaftar','[%s] New Product Added'=>'[%s] Produk Baru Ditambahkan','[%s] Your product has been approved!'=>'[%s] Produk Anda telah disetujui!','Dokan New Product'=>'Produk Baru Dokan','New Product emails are sent to chosen recipient(s) when a new product is created by vendors.'=>'Email Produk Baru dikirimkan ke penerima yang dipilih saat produk baru dibuat oleh vendor.','[{site_name}] A New product is added by ({seller_name}) - {product_title}'=>'[{site_name}] Produk baru ditambahkan oleh ({seller_name}) - {product_title}','New product added by Vendor {seller_name}'=>'Produk baru ditambahkan oleh Vendor {seller_name}','Recipient(s)'=>'Penerima','Enter recipients (comma separated) for this email. Defaults to %s.'=>'Masukkan penerima (dipisahkan koma) untuk email ini. Defaultnya adalah %s.','Dokan New Pending Product'=>'Produk Baru Dokan yang Tertunda','New Pending Product emails are sent to chosen recipient(s) when a new product is created by vendors.'=>'Email Produk Baru Tertunda dikirimkan ke penerima yang dipilih saat produk baru dibuat oleh vendor.','[{site_title}] A New product is pending from ({seller_name}) - {product_title}'=>'[{site_title}] Produk baru sedang menunggu dari ({seller_name}) - {product_title}','New pending product added by Vendor {seller_name}'=>'Produk baru yang tertunda ditambahkan oleh Vendor {seller_name}','Enter recipients (comma separated) for this email. Defaults to %1$s.'=>'Masukkan penerima (dipisahkan koma) untuk email ini. Defaultnya adalah %1$s.','Dokan New Seller Registered'=>'Penjual Baru Dokan Terdaftar','These emails are sent to chosen recipient(s) when a new vendor registers in marketplace'=>'Email ini dikirim ke penerima yang dipilih ketika vendor baru mendaftar di pasar','[{site_name}] A New vendor has registered'=>'[{site_name}] Vendor baru telah terdaftar','New Vendor Registered - {seller_name}'=>'Vendor Baru Terdaftar - {seller_name}','Dokan Pending Product Published'=>'Produk Dokan Tertunda Diterbitkan','These emails are sent to vendor of the product when a pending product is published.'=>'Email ini dikirimkan ke vendor produk saat produk yang tertunda diterbitkan.','[{site_name}] Your product - {product_title} - is now published'=>'[{site_name}] Produk Anda - {product_title} - sekarang diterbitkan','{product_title} - is published'=>'{product_title} - diterbitkan','Dokan Reverse Withdrawal Invoice'=>'Faktur Penarikan Terbalik Dokan','These emails are sent to the vendor(s) who has a due reverse withdrawal payment based on settings.'=>'Email ini dikirimkan ke vendor yang memiliki pembayaran penarikan terbalik yang jatuh tempo berdasarkan pengaturan.','[{site_title}]: Your {month} invoice for store: {store_name} is available'=>'[{site_title}]: Faktur {month} Anda untuk toko: {store_name} tersedia','Your latest {site_title} invoice'=>'Faktur {site_title} terbaru Anda','Thanks for using {site_url}!'=>'Terima kasih telah menggunakan {site_url}!','Additional content'=>'Konten tambahan','Text to appear below the main email content.'=>'Teks akan muncul di bawah konten email utama.','N/A'=>'Tidak tersedia','Dokan Vendor Completed Order'=>'Vendor Dokan Telah Menyelesaikan Pesanan','Completed order emails are sent to chosen recipient(s) when a order is completed.'=>'Email pesanan yang telah selesai dikirimkan ke penerima yang dipilih saat pesanan telah selesai.','[{site_title}] Your customer order is now complete ({order_number}) - {order_date}'=>'[{site_title}] Pesanan pelanggan Anda sekarang sudah selesai ({order_number}) - {order_date}','Complete Customer Order: #{order_number}'=>'Pesanan Pelanggan Lengkap: #{order_number}','Dokan Vendor New Order'=>'Pesanan Baru Vendor Dokan','New order emails are sent to chosen recipient(s) when a new order is received.'=>'Email pesanan baru dikirimkan ke penerima yang dipilih saat pesanan baru diterima.','[{site_title}] New customer order ({order_number}) - {order_date}'=>'[{site_title}] Pesanan pelanggan baru ({order_number}) - {order_date}','New Customer Order: #{order_number}'=>'Pesanan Pelanggan Baru: #{order_number}','Dokan Vendor Product Review'=>'Ulasan Produk Vendor Dokan','After a product has been reviewed, an email is sent to the vendor containing information about the review. The email may include details such as the reviewer’s name, the product’s name and description, the review rating, and the review text. The email may also contain a link to the review page where the vendor can view the review and respond to it if necessary.'=>'Setelah produk diulas, email akan dikirim ke vendor yang berisi informasi tentang ulasan tersebut. Email tersebut dapat berisi detail seperti nama pengulas, nama dan deskripsi produk, peringkat ulasan, dan teks ulasan. Email tersebut juga dapat berisi tautan ke halaman ulasan tempat vendor dapat melihat ulasan dan menanggapinya jika perlu.','New Product Review Alert from {site_title}'=>'Peringatan Ulasan Produk Baru dari {site_title}','New Product Review Alert From Your Store: {store_name} at - {site_title}'=>'Peringatan Ulasan Produk Baru Dari Toko Anda: {store_name} di - {site_title}','Dokan New Withdrawal Request'=>'Permintaan Penarikan Baru Dokan','These emails are sent to chosen recipient(s) when a vendor send request to withdraw'=>'Email ini dikirim ke penerima yang dipilih ketika vendor mengirim permintaan penarikan','[{site_name}] A New withdrawal request is made by {user_name}'=>'[{site_name}] Permintaan penarikan baru dibuat oleh {user_name}','New Withdraw Request from - {user_name}'=>'Permintaan Penarikan Baru dari - {user_name}','Dokan Withdraw Approved'=>'Penarikan Dokan Disetujui','These emails are sent to vendor when a vendor withdraw request is approved'=>'Email ini dikirim ke vendor ketika permintaan penarikan vendor disetujui','[{site_name}] Your withdrawal request was approved'=>'[{site_name}] Permintaan penarikan Anda telah disetujui','Withdrawal request for {amount} is approved'=>'Permintaan penarikan sebesar {jumlah} disetujui','Dokan Withdraw cancelled'=>'Penarikan Dokan dibatalkan','These emails are sent to vendor when a vendor withdraw request is cancelled'=>'Email ini dikirim ke vendor ketika permintaan penarikan vendor dibatalkan','[{site_name}] Your withdrawal request was cancelled'=>'[{site_name}] Permintaan penarikan Anda dibatalkan','Withdrawal request for {amount} is cancelled'=>'Permintaan penarikan sebesar {jumlah} dibatalkan','You need to login before applying for vendor.'=>'Anda perlu masuk sebelum mengajukan permohonan ke vendor.','You are already a vendor.'=>'Anda sudah menjadi vendor.','Enter your first name.'=>'Masukkan nama depan Anda.','Enter your shop name.'=>'Masukkan nama toko Anda.','Enter your phone number.'=>'Masukkan nomor telepon Anda.','You are an administrator. Please use dokan admin settings to enable your selling capabilities.'=>'Anda adalah administrator. Harap gunakan pengaturan admin dokan untuk mengaktifkan kemampuan penjualan Anda.','Products'=>'Produk','Orders'=>'Pesanan','No Title'=>'Tidak ada judul','Visit Store'=>'Kunjungi Toko','Edit Account'=>'Edit Akun','Log out'=>'Keluar','%1$s is not of type %2$s'=>'%1$s bukan tipe %2$s','%s was not registered as a request argument.'=>'%s tidak terdaftar sebagai argumen permintaan.','No store found with given store id'=>'Tidak ada toko yang ditemukan dengan id toko yang diberikan','Online'=>'On line','Draft'=>'Draf','Pending Review'=>'Tinjauan Tertunda','Scheduled'=>'Dijadwalkan','Simple Product'=>'Produk Sederhana','Variable Product'=>'Produk Variabel','Grouped Product'=>'Produk yang dikelompokkan','External/Affiliate Product'=>'Produk Eksternal/Afiliasi','Author'=>'Pengarang','Terms and Conditions'=>'syarat dan Ketentuan','Account Name: %s'=>'Nama Akun: %s','Account Number: %s'=>'Nom